app-not-opened = { $app } could not be opened
app-not-opened-body = It quit while opening. Try again, or reinstall it if this keeps happening.
app-crashed = { $app } quit unexpectedly
app-crashed-body = Click to open it again.
app-out-of-memory = { $app } was closed because memory ran low
app-out-of-memory-body = Your computer ran out of memory and closed it to keep everything else working. Click to open it again.
task-out-of-memory = A background task was stopped because memory ran low
task-out-of-memory-body = Your computer ran out of memory and stopped { $unit } to keep everything else working.
